---
title: Ars Nouveau compat
pageSlug: ars-nouveau
mod: spell-codex
section: gameplay
order: 4
---

Ars Nouveau is not in this jar. You want [Spell Codex Ars Compat](/mods/spell-codex-ars-compat) sitting next to Codex and Actionbar.

That addon adds a **Spell Conversion Station**. You put a caster tome in, click **Add to Codex**, and the glyph recipe becomes an Ars card on this Codex. Casting still spends Iron’s mana. Ars source is not touched.

If you are writing a pack that has both Iron’s and Ars, treat the station as the bridge. Players keep one HUD and one mana pool. They do not have to remember which wheel belongs to which mod.
